  m_text: '1. You and Enemies get stronger with each round, unless you search for
    an enemy

    2. You can only discard up to 3 cards at a time

    3. Searching
    for a potion has a 35% chance of sucess, but potions heal more than resting

    4.
    The Heart Button makes you crit for double damage'
